 all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It's now healthy, with its error rate down from 18% to 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** INC-0001 (SEV2) is open for payments-worker, and the on-call engineer has been paged. It covers the bad v3.4.0 release, the rollback, the denied payments-api rollback and the follow-up items.\n\n**Still unresolved:** payments-api is still on v5.1.0, marked unhealthy, with an 18% error rate. It could have its own problem, or it may just take time to recover now that the worker is fixed. I haven't acted on it further because its rollback was denied. If the error rate doesn't drop soon, the on-call engineer should look at payments-api; rolling it back to v5.0.0, its last healthy release, is the option if needed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KvkXM4U7ePjQCfYALSNyVw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01XjuQd1JvjeC1hgoJNwMas9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VBX1pPboWcx8Qxz8Dt6PFc", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01LwJJ1itvNaLfdDD5EfRaS4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_013PcwDZiuUpQkYuKYFgsaFn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Q88ZLamG3CvoANbnMH2ytf", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Hp3vNKE2p